{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":87,"count":45,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L03-1-08\",\"兩\",\"兩\",\"两\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我想買兩本中文書、一本英文書。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng mǎi liǎng běn Zhōngwén shū, yì běn Yīngwén shū.","english":"I want to buy two books in Chinese and a book in English.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-10","sourceFront":"中文","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"友美愛看書，我想送她兩本中文書，你呢？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi ài kànshū, wǒ xiǎng sòng tā liǎng běn Zhōngwén shū, nǐ ne?","english":"Youmei loves reading. I would like to give her two books in Chinese as a gift. How about you?","sourceCardId":"B1L03-1-01","sourceFront":"買","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我有兩枝鉛筆。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu liǎng zhī qiānbǐ.","english":"I have two pencils.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-08","sourceFront":"枝","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我們買兩枝，好不好？兩枝五十塊錢。","pinyin":"Wǒmen mǎi liǎng zhī, hǎo bù hǎo? Liǎng zhī wǔshí kuài qián.","english":"How about we buy two of them? Two for 50NT dollars.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-2-01","sourceFront":"這","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我有一位英國老師和兩位日本老師。","pinyin":"Wǒ yǒu yí wèi Yīngguó lǎoshī hé liǎng wèi Rìběn lǎoshī.","english":"I have one British teacher and two Japanese teachers.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-09","sourceFront":"位","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這些東西一共兩萬三千五百零五塊。","pinyin":"Zhèxiē dōngxi yígòng liǎng wàn sān qiān wǔ bǎi líng wǔ kuài.","english":"These stuff cost twenty three thousand, five hundred and five dollars in total.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-20","sourceFront":"零","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我媽媽有一個哥哥跟兩個妹妹。","pinyin":"Wǒ māma yǒu yí ge gēge gēn liǎng ge mèimei.","english":"My mom has an elder brother and two younger sisters.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-18","sourceFront":"妹妹","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"客廳裡面有兩張沙發。","pinyin":"Kètīng lǐmiàn yǒu liǎng zhāng shāfā.","english":"There are two sofas in the living room.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-19","sourceFront":"沙發","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我家有一隻貓、兩隻狗和三隻鳥。","pinyin":"Wǒ jiā yǒu yì zhī māo, liǎng zhī gǒu hé sān zhī niǎo.","english":"I have a cat, two dogs, and three birds in my house.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-10","sourceFront":"隻","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小姐，我們要點兩碗牛肉麵和兩杯茶。","pinyin":"Xiǎojiě, wǒmen yào diǎn liǎng wǎn niúròu miàn hé liǎng bēi chá.","english":"Miss, we would like to order two bowls of beef noodles and two cups of tea.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"請問兩位要紅茶還是綠茶？","pinyin":"Qǐngwèn liǎng wèi yào hóngchá háishì lǜchá?","english":"Would you like to have black tea or green tea?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一共兩百一十五塊錢。","pinyin":"Yígòng liǎng bǎi yīshíwǔ kuài qián.","english":"It will be 215 dollars in total.","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一共兩百多塊錢，好便宜！","pinyin":"Yígòng liǎng bǎi duō kuài qián, hǎo piányi!","english":"It is only a little over 200. It is cheap!","sourceCardId":"B1L04-2-01","sourceFront":"點","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們這個星期六下午兩點半去吧。","pinyin":"Wǒmen zhè ge xīngqí liù xiàwǔ liǎng diǎn bàn qù ba.","english":"Let’s go this Saturday at 2:30 p.m.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-1-01","sourceFront":"錢包","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩天天氣有點兒冷，我們週末去，好嗎？","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiān tiānqì yǒudiǎnr lěng, wǒmen zhōumò qù, hǎo ma?","english":"It is a bit cold those two days. How about we do it this weekend?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這兩條我都去穿穿看。","pinyin":"Zhè liǎng tiáo wǒ dōu qù chuānchuān kàn.","english":"I will try both on.","sourceCardId":"B1L08-2-01","sourceFront":"黃色","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 一(one) 巾(cloth) hides an 入(tucked) upside-down person → 兩(two)."},{"key":"[\"B1L09-1-07\",\"非常\",\"非常\",\"非常\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我們可以去問家樂，他非常聰明，我想他懂。","pinyin":"Wǒmen kěyǐ qù wèn Jiālè, tā fēicháng cōngmíng, wǒ xiǎng tā dǒng.","english":"We can ask Jiale; he is very smart. I think he understands it.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-01","sourceFront":"句子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":3},{"chinese":"我去年去看了，很多大人帶著小孩去看燈會，非常熱鬧，我照了很多相片。","pinyin":"Wǒ qùnián qù kàn le, hěn duō dàrén dài zhe xiǎohái qù kàn dēnghuì, fēicháng rènào, wǒ zhào le hěn duō xiàngpiàn.","english":"Last year I went to see the Carnival. Many adults brought their children to see the Lantern Carnival, and it was very lively. I took a lot of photos.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"非(not) + 常(common) → not common, so 'very' (extraordinary)."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-3-05\",\"小心\",\"小心\",\"小心\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"走路跟騎腳踏車的時候，我們都要小心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-3-05","sourceFront":"小心","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他因為打籃球的時候不小心，所以手受傷了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-3-06","sourceFront":"受傷","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"A:對不起，我不小心拿了你的書？ B:原來書在你這裡，我剛才在教室裡找了好久。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-1-08","sourceFront":"原來","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"上樓、下樓的時候都不要急，小心走。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-08","sourceFront":"急","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你不要亂吃東西，小心肚子疼！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-21","sourceFront":"亂","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我去義大利旅行的時候，不小心把護照弄丟了，我擔心死了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-13","sourceFront":"死","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在山上烤肉時要非常注意，一不小心就可能引起森林火災。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-39","sourceFront":"火災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個工人使用工廠的機器時，不小心發生了意外，流了很多血。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-37","sourceFront":"血","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條馬路高低不平，為了避免發生意外，開車經過時一定要小心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-15","sourceFront":"平","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有一些交友網站上的個人姓名、年齡等資料都是假的，所以上網交友要小心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-19","sourceFront":"假","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:糟了，我不小心把隨身碟弄丟了，資料都存在裡面。 B:這下子我們的期末報告都白做了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-20","sourceFront":"這下子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這條路不平，有民眾貼了海報，請大家走路時要小心，以免受傷。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-26","sourceFront":"以免","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"外面下著大雨，路很滑，請小心開車。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-27","sourceFront":"滑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你上班別遲到，小心公司扣你的錢！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-47","sourceFront":"扣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座橋對車子的高度有限制，開大車的人要小心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-11","sourceFront":"高度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"博物館內的藝術品價值都很高，不小心弄壞了可是要賠償不少錢的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-09","sourceFront":"賠償","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"火鍋(hotpot)剛煮好時很燙，吃的時候小心點兒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-23","sourceFront":"燙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這種植物的葉子尖尖的，流出來的汁又臭又黏，觀察時要小心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-13","sourceFront":"尖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在瀑布旁邊照相要看看周圍環境，別不小心掉下去了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-36","sourceFront":"瀑布","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過那次任務教訓後，小周做事就變得更加小心了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-11","sourceFront":"教訓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個小孩跑得太快，一不小心就跌倒了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-02","sourceFront":"跌倒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有不小心發生錯誤的時候，不需要取笑別人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-22","sourceFront":"取笑","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"史小姐到花蓮來觀光時不小心迷了路，幸虧遇到了熱心的阿姨送她回旅館。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-40","sourceFront":"熱心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他不小心摔壞了新買的手機，因此難過得要命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-14","sourceFront":"摔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"小心 means careful: keep a small (小) heart (心) → cautious and alert."},{"key":"[\"B1L15-2-01\",\"著\",\"著\",\"着\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"中明，你手裡拿著什麼？","pinyin":"Zhōngmíng, nǐ shǒu lǐ ná zhe shénme?","english":"Zhongming, what you are holding in your hand?","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我去年去看了，很多大人帶著小孩去看燈會，非常熱鬧，我照了很多相片。","pinyin":"Wǒ qùnián qù kàn le, hěn duō dàrén dài zhe xiǎohái qù kàn dēnghuì, fēicháng rènào, wǒ zhào le hěn duō xiàngpiàn.","english":"Last year I went to see the Carnival. Many adults brought their children to see the Lantern Carnival, and it was very lively. I took a lot of photos.","sourceCardId":"B1L15-2-01","sourceFront":"著","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"a 艹(grass) grows over 者(those who) wait → 著(particle)."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-1-26\",\"花蓮\",\"花蓮\",\"花莲\",\"Name\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:這些相片是在哪裡照的？ B:花蓮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L11-3-11","sourceFront":"相片","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我買了幾包花蓮當地的名產，要送給台北的朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-04","sourceFront":"名產","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"週末到花蓮的火車票一下子就賣光了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-19","sourceFront":"光","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這班車早上七點從台北出發，只停了三個站就到花蓮了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-25","sourceFront":"出發","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮的風景很美，我想多留兩天，慢慢地看。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-16","sourceFront":"留","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮那幾家旅館的雙人客房都客滿了，我們還是訂民宿吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-30","sourceFront":"客房","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮太魯閣的確很漂亮，難怪每年都吸引許多觀光客去參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-15","sourceFront":"的確","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"史小姐到花蓮來觀光時不小心迷了路，幸虧遇到了熱心的阿姨送她回旅館。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-40","sourceFront":"熱心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"花蓮 Hualien: picture a flower (花) and a lotus (蓮) blooming on Taiwan's east coast."},{"key":"[\"B2L03-1-28\",\"水費\",\"水費\",\"水费\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個房子的房租不包括水費、電費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-30","sourceFront":"電","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我的房租每個月一萬塊，加上水費、電費，差不多一萬三。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-22","sourceFront":"加上","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-24\",\"底\",\"底\",\"底\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個月底我就可以學完這本書了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-24","sourceFront":"底","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"你剛剛說要吃漢堡，現在說要吃炸雞，到底要吃什麼？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-44","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到底哪一種冰淇淋最好吃，得看個人的口味。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-12","sourceFront":"個人","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到底哪一種冰淇淋最好吃，得看個人的口味。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-13","sourceFront":"口味","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣是一個海島國家，周圍的海底有豐富的珍貴資源。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-02","sourceFront":"島","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為天氣太熱了，有一隻貓在車子底下休息，不肯離開。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-17","sourceFront":"底下","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"地震後救災人員把握分分秒秒，努力把被困在房子底下的民眾救出來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-29","sourceFront":"分分秒秒","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個人都有夢想，只要不怕挑戰、堅持到底，就能夢想成真。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-08","sourceFront":"到底","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我知道那輛德國汽車很貴，至於到底多貴，我就不清楚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-33","sourceFront":"至於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你聽了尤老闆勇敢克服困難、堅持到底的真實故事，有什麼感想？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-02","sourceFront":"感想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時候孩子不明白自己到底犯了什麼錯，父母應該好好跟他們溝通。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-10","sourceFront":"犯錯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:我到底該怎麼做才能讓老闆滿意？ B:你太驕傲、個性太急， 做事也不夠仔細。總之， 先把自己的缺點改掉吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-28","sourceFront":"總之","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到底上帝存在不存在，科學與宗教的觀點不同，說法也不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-19","sourceFront":"觀點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的鞋底快要掉下來了，得去店裡請人把它粘起來。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-40","sourceFront":"黏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Under a wide 广(broad) roof reaching the lowest foundation: 底(bottom)."},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-02\",\"要求\",\"要求\",\"要求\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"老師的要求很多，要寫五篇報告、三篇作文，怎麼寫得完？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-02","sourceFront":"要求","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"如果想得到獎學金，必須達成每科成績八十五分以上的要求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-05","sourceFront":"達成","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"擔任這家公司的主管真不容易，不僅要管理整個部門的員工，還要達成老闆的工作要求。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-23","sourceFront":"主管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大雄從小個性就很被動，別人要求的事他才做，父母跟老師都希望他可以主動一點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-15","sourceFront":"被動","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王老闆老是要求員工隨時配合他開會、加班、出差，真教人受不了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-27","sourceFront":"教","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"明天的主管會議在三樓的會議室舉行，經理要求大家不要遲到。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-05","sourceFront":"會議","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家公司雖然要求員工得穿西裝上班，但費用全是公司負擔的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-33","sourceFront":"西裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"七歲以下的孩子對手部動作還無法完全地掌握，因此不應要求他們正確地握筆。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-32","sourceFront":"握","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司上頭要求小張一個人完成任務，同事們都認為有點兒勉強。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-22","sourceFront":"勉強","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"部分大學科系對學生成績的要求非常高，畢業條件也較嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-14","sourceFront":"科系","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"開會前經理要求大家勿開手機，專心討論會議內容。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-10","sourceFront":"勿","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母要求孩子不論在任何情況都不許騙人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-16","sourceFront":"不許","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次的說話比賽要求參加的學生說一個神奇的外國故事。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-14","sourceFront":"神奇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 要(essential) and 求(beg): 要求 means require, to demand."},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-37\",\"年年有余\",\"年年有餘\",\"年年有余\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L15-2-28\",\"做人做事\",\"做人做事\",\"做人做事\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"經理做事態度認真、負責，我從他身上學到了很多做人做事的道理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-11","sourceFront":"身上","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母做人做事的態度，對孩子會產生極大的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-13","sourceFront":"產生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他畢竟是個小孩子，還不懂做人做事的道理，等他長大就會明白了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-19","sourceFront":"畢竟","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母除了教導孩子做人做事的道理，也應該肯定他們的表現，讓他們更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-08","sourceFront":"教導","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"父母是孩子的榜樣，他們的性格和做人做事的態度，對孩子都有很大的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-06","sourceFront":"榜樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L04-2-14\",\"說法\",\"說法\",\"说法\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"聽說坐月子時不能洗頭髮，要不然對身體不好，你相信這樣的說法嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-14","sourceFront":"說法","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"根據專家的說法，想要身體健康，一天至少得喝五大杯水。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-09","sourceFront":"至少","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"到底上帝存在不存在，科學與宗教的觀點不同，說法也不一樣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-19","sourceFront":"觀點","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這班學生多數都會說法國話，其中有半數是從歐洲來的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-36","sourceFront":"半數","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"根據華人民間的說法，過年時如果收到紅包，整年就會有好運氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-23","sourceFront":"民間","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 說(speak) and 法(law): 說法 means version."},{"key":"[\"B3L06-1-30\",\"好了\",\"好了\",\"好了\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他說他會去看醫生，請我們不要擔心，如果他好了，就會來學校上課。","pinyin":"Tā shuō tā huì qù kàn yīshēng, qǐng wǒmen bú yào dānxīn, rúguǒ tā hǎo le, jiù huì lái xuéxiào shàngkè.","english":"He said he will go see a doctor and he does not want to worry us. If he feels better, he will come to school.","sourceCardId":"B1L10-3-01","sourceFront":"打電話","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"太好了！在那裡看書很舒服。我們每天都能用那間教室嗎？","pinyin":"Tài hǎo le! Zài nàlǐ kànshū hěn shūfu. Wǒmen měi tiān dōu néng yòng nà jiān jiàoshì ma?","english":"That’s awesome! Studying there is very comfortable. Can we use it every day?","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"太好了！我最愛吃牛肉麵。他們也賣飲料嗎？","pinyin":"Tài hǎo le! Wǒ zuì ài chī niúròu miàn. Tāmen yě mài yǐnliào ma?","english":"That is awesome! Beef noodles is my favorite. Do they sell drinks as well?","sourceCardId":"B1L04-1-01","sourceFront":"咖啡","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"好(good) + 了(change) → now good, so getting well."},{"key":"[\"B3L08-1-17\",\"商业\",\"商業\",\"商业\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這棟商業大樓的規模很大，除了有很多商店、餐廳，還有電影院、健身房。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-17","sourceFront":"商業","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L10-2-19\",\"符合\",\"符合\",\"符合\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"為了符合市場的需求，「快時尚」公司不斷地設計出最流行的服裝樣式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-19","sourceFront":"符合","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"新型筆電銷售時價格通常比較貴，有時倒不如買符合個人需要的舊型筆電。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-34","sourceFront":"型","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老謝溫柔體貼、聰明英俊，符合我結婚對象的條件，因此我答應嫁給他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-42","sourceFront":"嫁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你的才能符合我們公司的條件，是我們需要的人才。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-18","sourceFront":"才能","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 符(amulet) and 合(combine): 符合 means be up to, to be in accord with."},{"key":"[\"B3L11-1-21\",\"同情\",\"同情\",\"同情\",\"Vst\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在那場車禍中，那個孩子失去了父母，家裡只剩下他一個人，大家都很同情他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-21","sourceFront":"同情","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Combining 同(same) and 情(feeling): 同情 means sympathize with, to feel pity for."},{"key":"[\"B3L12-2-05\",\"儘管\",\"儘管\",\"尽管\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"儘管爺爺去世很久了，但每次看到照片，就會回想起他開心陪我玩的樣子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-05","sourceFront":"儘管","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"儘管這次推銷新產品的活動辦得很順利，顧客的反應也很好，不過還是有需要改進的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-06","sourceFront":"改進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"儘管他沒主持過什麼節目，他的獨特風格仍然引起大家注意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-42","sourceFront":"主持","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 儘(exhaust) and 管(manage): 儘管 means even though, in spite of."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-1-06\",\"帳號\",\"帳號\",\"帐号\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 帳(tent) and 號(mark): 帳號 means account."},{"key":"[\"B3L14-1-07\",\"姑娘\",\"姑娘\",\"姑娘\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個山區種了許多茶樹，到了收穫季節，就會有一群採茶姑娘上山採茶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-12","sourceFront":"採","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 姑(father's sister) and 娘(mother): 姑娘 means girl."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-1-41\",\"沒話說\",\"沒話說\",\"没话说\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"臺灣的芒果冰好吃得沒話說，連吃過的外國人也十分滿意","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-41","sourceFront":"沒話說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"A:今年銷售商品的成績比以往差， 大家都說是你的責任。 B:你是我最好的朋友，連你也這麼認為，我就沒話說了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-41","sourceFront":"沒話說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":"Having 沒(gone) critical 話(talk) left to 說(speak): 沒話說 means beyond words."},{"key":"[\"B3L15-2-10\",\"圖畫\",\"圖畫\",\"图画\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"只有圖畫，沒有文字的故事書 ，能夠留給兒童想像及思考的空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-10","sourceFront":"圖畫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這面牆壁上的圖畫真美，是誰畫的？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-10","sourceFront":"牆壁","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這幅設計圖畫得很仔細，畫圖的人應該相當細心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-36","sourceFront":"幅","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 圖(picture) and 畫(picture): 圖畫 means picture, illustration."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-1-01\",\"麵條\",\"麵條\",\"面条\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"哥哥去超市買了一袋玉米和兩包麵條，要為家人準備晚餐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-03","sourceFront":"玉米","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"小孩子剛學習用筷子吃麵條時，常需要媽媽先替他把麵拌一拌。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-30","sourceFront":"拌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Long strips of kneaded 麵(face) dough sliced into a 條(strip): 麵條 means noodles."},{"key":"[\"B4L01-1-18\",\"伸手\",\"伸手\",\"伸手\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"危險物品必須放在小朋友伸手拿不到的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-18","sourceFront":"伸手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L04-2-05\",\"产\",\"產\",\"产\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我的家鄉出產小麥、葡萄，可是不產茶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-05","sourceFront":"產","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"我們國家出口的農產品很有名，不但價格低，品質又好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-02","sourceFront":"出口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"在地理條件好的地區，不但農產品種類較多，價格也便宜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-06","sourceFront":"農產品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":3},{"chinese":"這次茶會主要是為了招待客戶，同時透過這個茶會來發表公司的新產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-12","sourceFront":"茶會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":3},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"著名的科學家愛因斯坦（ Àiyīnsītǎn, Albert Einstein）發明了相對論（Theory of Relativity），這個理論對後來的科學研究產生了重大的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-21","sourceFront":"理論","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"經過服務人員詳細地說明，使得客人對公司的產品更了解了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-13","sourceFront":"使得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"儘管這次推銷新產品的活動辦得很順利，顧客的反應也很好，不過還是有需要改進的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-06","sourceFront":"改進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"科學家早就證明了氣溫的變化對農業生產有不好的影響，可是到目前還找不到解決的好辦法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-22","sourceFront":"證明","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次會議的主題跟銷售新產品有關，所以廣告部門的人員得參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-02","sourceFront":"主題","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"如想通過那家企業的面試，就得先熟悉他們的產品特色與銷售方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-18","sourceFront":"如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:對這次新產品的銷售方式，你有什麼想法？ B:我在這方面沒什麼經驗，你可以去請教方經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-07","sourceFront":"方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"假如貴公司想擴大生產規模，可以參考本公司的作法，我們很願意提供協助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-06","sourceFront":"參考","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"聽到老闆跟經理的對話，我才知道公司新產品的銷售成績不理想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-17","sourceFront":"對話","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現代各式各樣的科技產品，讓人們的生活更舒適、便利","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-02","sourceFront":"現代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家工廠自從改善了設備以後，生產速度就一天比一天快了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-01","sourceFront":"自從","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我們公司打算今年跟美國合作，生產名牌皮包","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-03","sourceFront":"合作","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"父母做人做事的態度，對孩子會產生極大的影響。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-13","sourceFront":"產生","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"公司的生產部門這個月規劃了員工旅遊，有三個不同地點讓大家選擇。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-02","sourceFront":"規劃","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個星期經理一連寫了三個推銷新產品的計畫，每天都忙得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-35","sourceFront":"一連","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這次的水災不僅淹了整條街，好幾家工廠也因為淹水沒辦法生產，真是太糟了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-29","sourceFront":"水災","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"就要開會了，可是我同事還沒把新產品的說明資料準備好，真叫人緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-03","sourceFront":"叫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家工廠生產的皮鞋、皮帶，不但品質好，價錢也不貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-16","sourceFront":"生產","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"來來來，快來買！我們3C產品的價格最優惠，品質也很好，快把握機會喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-13","sourceFront":"優惠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這裡的每一樣產品都是老闆自己設計的，別的地方找不到相同的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-06","sourceFront":"樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"A:謝謝你的幫助。沒有你的話， 我一個人很難完成新產品的廣告設計。 B:別這麼說。我們是同事，互相幫助是應該的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-44","sourceFront":"別這麼說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"電腦、手機、平板等等，都是3C產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-22","sourceFront":"等等","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"請你說明一下，這些產品的功能有什麼差別？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-06","sourceFront":"功能","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我買了幾包花蓮當地的名產，要送給台北的朋友。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-04","sourceFront":"名產","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"人類活動產生許多垃圾，不但汙染了環境，更改變了全球氣候。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-45","sourceFront":"汙染","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"汽車的汽油燃燒不完全的話，容易產生很多廢氣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-49","sourceFront":"廢氣","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"過度消費及使用塑膠材料的產品，都會增加自然環境的負擔。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-24","sourceFront":"塑膠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那項新產品的設計圖你一個人負責太辛苦了，倒不如找同事一起來做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-17","sourceFront":"倒不如","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理對新產品計畫的指示不太清楚，我們最好去問清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-01","sourceFront":"指示","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個農村裡有個小農場，他們生產的鮮奶