ing 協(assist) and 助(help): 協助 means assist."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"參\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"厽(stacked mounds) rest above a 人(person) brushing 彡(hair) → ready to 參(take part in)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"回想\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Stepping 回(measure word for time) into or toward 想(think): 回想 means recall."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"心\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A curved bowl with three drops inside pulses like a beating 心(heart)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"掌握\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 掌(in charge) and 握(grasp): 掌握 means grasp, to master."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"教導\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"To 教(education) a 導(direct): 教導 means guide, to teach."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"晚飯\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"晚飯 means dinner: 晚(evening) + 飯(meal) → the evening meal."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"櫃\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Sturdy planks of timber from a seasoned 木(tree) are crafted into a locked storage 匱(cabinet)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"相反\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 相(mutual) and 反(reverse): 相反 means opposite, contrary."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"突然\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 突(sudden) and 然(certainly): 突然 means suddenly."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"老家\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Mastering skills in 老(old) within the 家(family): 老家 means hometown."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"黃\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"廿(Twenty) 一(one) rows across a 田(field), the 八(eight) sheaves ripe → all 黃(yellow)."}]}
